    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">85 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Build it yourself: 90 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine-coding case study</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 33 of 45</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Doctor Appointment &amp; Fitness Class Booking</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">One design, two famous machine-coding prompts: Flipkart's doctor booking and the FlipFit / PhonePe fitness class. Slots with a capacity, a waitlist that promotes the next person on a cancel, rules like \"no two bookings at the same time\" and \"Silver tier gets 3 classes\", a pluggable ranking, and booking that stays correct when fifty people tap \"Book\" at once. Running code in Java, Python and C++.</p>\n"
